---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service • Run My Brief">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
      
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 space-y-3">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs text-[#2563EB] hover:underline font-mono font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
          <span>&larr;</span> <span>Return to Sandbox Overview</span>
        </a>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-[#2563EB] font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Platform Agreement
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0F172A]">
          Terms of Service &amp; Usage Protocol
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- BODY CONTENT -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 1. Platform Scope &amp; License</h2>
          <p>
            Run My Brief licenses interactive check-in cards, review routing tools, and snag notification webhooks to trade businesses. By deploying our links, cards, or QR gateways on job sites or invoices, you agree to these operational terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 2. Third-Party Platform Policies</h2>
          <p>
            Our gateway directs customers to third-party review endpoints (such as Google Business Profile and Google Local Services). Clients remain solely responsible for ensuring their customer engagement adheres to all applicable third-party platform terms and consumer protection rules.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 3. Dispatch &amp; Snag Delivery</h2>
          <p>
            Private feedback cards are provided to facilitate immediate resolution of customer issues. While our webhook engines transmit snag payloads in real time, client dispatch teams are responsible for monitoring their notification destinations and resolving homeowner tickets.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            Run My Brief provides software infrastructure to triage feedback and streamline review collection. We do not guarantee specific Google Maps ranking positions, review quantities, or customer sentiment ratings.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>